      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwinj maeni, E ot pa Yakobo, m’ulwongre ku nying’ Israel, man m’uai kud i pi mi Yuda; m’ukwong’o kwong’ ku nying’ Yehova, man m’uweco pi Mungu mir Israel, ento ku lemandha ngo, kadi ku bedopwe de ngo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(kum gilwongri gigi mir adhura ma leng’, man gijengri gigi kum Mungu mir Israel; nyinge Yehova mir udul): ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayero gin ma kwong’a ugambre con; eyo, giwok woko kud i dhoga, man anyuthogi: atimogi pio, e gitimbri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ang’eyo nia in i udhuko, man ng’uti en e ler mi nyunyu, man ternyimi mola; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno ayero maeni iri ugambre con; ma fodi etimbre ngo anyutho iri; imaru wacu kumae, mungu m’araga para timogi, man ayi gin m’acwia para m’ang’ika, kud ayi gin m’acwia para m’atwaga, ung’ologi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwinjo maeni; nen maeni ceke; man wun, wubiyero maeni ngo? anyutho iri gin ma nyen ugambre eni, en e gin m’upandre, ma fodi ing’eyo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jucwiogi kawono, man ugambre con ungo; e ma fodi ceng’ maeni kuwok ungo iwinjogi ngo; imaru wacu kumae, Nen, ang’eyogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo, iwinjo ngo; eyo, ing’eyo ngo; eyo, ugambre nindo ma con ithi bedo ayaba ngo: kum ang’eyo nia itimo kud abombi dit, man julwong’i won gondri ugambre i ic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum abikoweko ng’ecwiny para tundu pi nyinga, man abicera piri pi pak para, kara kud akebi woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, adwoki leng’, ento calu mola ma tar ungo; amuli i uka mi masendi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pira gira, pira gira, abitimo maeni; kum jucid nyinga pir ang’o? man abimio dwong’ para ni ng’atu mange ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
